Per-Host Resource Estimates: Memory=15.36GB
Analyzed query: SELECT l_returnflag, l_linestatus, count(DISTINCT l_orderkey,
l_linenumber), count(*), appx_median(l_quantity), appx_median(CASE WHEN
l_discount > CAST(0 AS DECIMAL(3,0)) THEN l_quantity END),
appx_median(l_extendedprice / l_quantity), appx_median(CASE WHEN l_discount >
CAST(0 AS DECIMAL(3,0)) THEN l_extendedprice / l_quantity END) FROM
tpch_parquet.lineitem GROUP BY l_returnflag, l_linestatus

